title: "Robust Stability Analysis of Positive Lur'e Systems with Neural Network Feedback (code)"
abstract: "MATLAB code for the CCTA 2025 paper: the closed-form stability radius of positive Lur'e systems and the sector-bound refinement for neural network feedback. It reproduces the two numerical examples of the paper."
